    "   - Checkbox is disabled (cursor not-allowed)",
    "   - Bundle-discount thresholds do NOT count BETA SKUs",
    "   - If a parent Module is BETA, its nested optional add-ons are HIDDEN",
    "   - BETA SKUs have NO pricing block until promoted to GA",
    "",
